🎯 What Could Have Happened?

One possible attack chain:

Credential Theft
      ↓
Account Access
      ↓
MFA Manipulation / Bypass
      ↓
Malicious Document
      ↓
PowerShell Execution
      ↓
Command & Control
      ↓
Data Collection
      ↓
Data Exfiltration

Notice the language:

"Possible"

A professional analyst should distinguish:

FACT

What the evidence directly shows.

INFERENCE

What the evidence suggests.

HYPOTHESIS

What might have happened but still needs confirmation.

This distinction is extremely important in professional incident reports.


