🔴 MITRE ATT&CK MAPPING

Now map observed behavior to attacker techniques.

Potential techniques include:

Initial Access

Possible:

Phishing

if evidence shows the malicious document came through email.


---

Execution

Command and Scripting Interpreter: PowerShell

because PowerShell was executed.


---

Credential Access

Potential credential theft.

But don't claim this unless evidence supports it.


---

Command & Control

